# Defect 291, 2026-10-05: U+202E written as itself on a line a message quoted
# reached the terminal in the excerpt, and drew the quoted line in another
# order than the one the compiler read. The override is refused written as
# itself since defect 283, and that refusal's own excerpt writes it by its
# code, `<U+202E>`, the caret padded by that width; an isolate likewise.

function main()
    x: i64 @ "‮abc"  #~ invisible_character
    print("⁦x⁩")  #~ invisible_character invisible_character
